## Precomputed LUT for IVF-PQ Distance Computation

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Precomputed LUT（预计算查找表）是IVF-PQ vector search中用于加速L2 distance计算的优化技术。在IVF-PQ中，query x与database vector y的距离公式为 d = ||x-y_c||² + ||y_R||² + 2(y_c·y_R) - 2(x·y_R)。其中||y_R||² + 2(y_c·y_R)仅依赖于cluster centroid y_c和residual vector y_R，与query无关，因此可在检索前precomputed并存储在LUT中。检索时直接从LUT lookup该precomputed term，避免repeated arithmetic（每个PQ codeword需要计算||y_R||²和y_c·y_R dot-product）。LUT size = ksub × M per cluster（如ksub=256, M=64 → 16K entries per cluster）。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Precomputed LUT在IVF-PQ retrieval kernel中的使用流程：```// Precomputation phase (offline, per cluster)
for each cluster c in nlist:
    for each sub-vector dimension m in 0..M-1:
        for each codeword k in 0..ksub-1:
            y_R_sub = PQ_codebook[c][m][k]  // residual sub-vector centroid
            y_C_sub = cluster_centroid[c][m]  // cluster centroid sub-vector
            LUT[c][m][k] = ||y_R_sub||² + 2 * (y_C_sub · y_R_sub)

// Retrieval phase (online, per query)
for each selected cluster c in nprobe:
    ||x_minus_yc||² = sum_m( (x[m] - y_c[m])² )  // computed once on GPU
    for each PQ_codeword cw in cluster c:
        d = ||x_minus_yc||²  // start with cluster distance term
        for each sub-vector dimension m in 0..M-1:
            k = cw.indices[m]  // 8-bit index into codebook
            y_R_sub = PQ_codebook[c][m][k]
            d += LUT[c][m][k]  // lookup precomputed term
            d -= 2 * (x[m] · y_R_sub)  // dot product with query sub-vector
        // d now contains full L2 distance
        update_top_k(d, cw.id)
```。在MNM PNM实现中：LUT precomputation由GPU完成并通过PNM_WR_MMIO写入PNM的precomputed table storage→PQ code scan kernel: MAC module并行计算x[m]·y_R_sub（24 FP16 MAC for 384-D）→hardware accumulator sums x·y_R with LUT[c][m][k] value and ||x-y_c||²→final distance d在single cycle完成（vs w/o LUT需要额外||y_R||²计算和y_c·y_R dot-product的multiple cycles）。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
GPU-based FAISS IVF-PQ实现often avoid precomputed LUT，因为：(a) LUT working set exceeds shared-memory capacity（per cluster LUT: ksub×M entries × embedding_dim dimensions—当ksub=256, M=64时为16K entries，需与warp threads共享）；(b) Under warp scheduling, LUT reuse benefit is limited（不同warps访问不同PQ codewords，LUT entries的temporal locality低）。MNM PNM approach采用precomputed LUT因为：dedicated LUT storage on logic die（无需shared-memory constraint）+ all scanners access same LUT（无warp scheduling导致的reuse问题）。EDAP（Energy-Delay-Area Product）analysis显示precomputed LUT带来13%-36% improvement across different embedding dimensions（192-D: 13%, 384-D: 36%, 768-D: 27%, 1536-D: 29%），因为eliminating repeated distance arithmetic logic节省的面积大于LUT storage overhead。

