Odd-Even Merge Sort硬件实现（MNM Top-k Selector）：面积0.003 mm²（ASAP 7nm PDK），功耗0.00395W @650MHz。Sorting network由固定连接的compare-and-swap单元组成（每个单元：comparator + 2-to-1 multiplexer for swap），无需control logic或branch prediction。与bitonic sort相比，Odd-Even Merge Sort使用更少的比较器但pipeline深度相似。在GPU上top-k selection通常使用：(a) bitonic sort on shared memory（适合warp-level parallelism但shared memory capacity limited）；(b) radix select（通过radix histogram pruning逐步缩小候选集）；(c) heap-based selection（sequential insertion, O(k log N)）。MNM PNM的hardware sorter优势：fixed-latency parallel sorting per cluster + 16-element sorting results直接与hardware maintained top-16 register merge，无需GPU→memory往返传输intermediate distances。

