## PIM-based GEMV Kernel for MHA (Score and Context Operations)

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
PIM-based GEMV kernel是将Transformer Multi-Head Attention中的Score（Q×K^T）和Context（Softmax×V）GEMV operations offload到PIM hardware执行的kernel调度策略。在autoregressive LLM decoding中，每个new token的Q vector需与累积的K cache矩阵和V cache矩阵进行GEMV操作——Score: Q_new (1×d_head) × K^T_cache (d_head×seq_len)产生attention scores；Context: Softmax_scores (1×seq_len) × V_cache (seq_len×d_head)产生context vector。这些操作operational intensity极低（~1 Op/Byte for FP16），在GPU上完全memory-bound。PIM-based implementation利用HBM bank-level internal bandwidth（>>external I/O bandwidth）实现all-bank parallel GEMV，从memory bandwidth而非compute throughput获得性能提升。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
MNM PIM-based MHA kernel执行流程（per attention head）：```// Precondition: K_cache (d_head × seq_len) stored in HBM rows across banks
//               V_cache (d_head × seq_len) stored in HBM rows across banks
//               Q_new (1 × d_head) computed by GPU QKV generation

// MNM PIM Score Kernel (Q × K^T → attention scores)
// Step 1: Write Q vector to global vector buffer
PIM_WR_GB(channel, Q_new_segment)  // Q分段写入，per channel global vector buffer
// Step 2: Activate K^T data in PIM row buffer (all banks parallel)
for each bank in parallel:  // all-bank parallel activation
    PIM_ACT_AB(bank, K_row_addr)  
    // Loads K^T column data into PIM row buffer
// Step 3: MAC dot-product (all banks parallel)
for each bank in parallel:
    for i in 0..15:  // 16 FP16 elements per cycle
        mac_result[bank] += PIM_row_buffer[i] * global_vector_buffer[i]
    // Accumulates in dedicated result register per bank
// Step 4: Transfer score results to Softmax Calculator on PNM logic die
PIM_MV_SB(channel, mac_result)  // MAC results → Score Buffer → PNM Softmax Calc

// Softmax (on PNM logic die): Find Max → Exp → Sum → Div

// MNM PIM Context Kernel (Softmax_scores × V → context vector)
// Step 5: Write softmax output back to global vector buffer  
PIM_WR_GB(channel, softmax_scores_segment)
// Step 6: Activate V data in PIM row buffer
PIM_ACT_AB(bank, V_row_addr)
// Step 7: MAC dot-product (all banks parallel)
for each bank in parallel:
    for i in 0..15:
        mac_result[bank] += PIM_row_buffer[i] * global_vector_buffer[i]
// Step 8: GPU reads final context vectors
RESULT_READ(channel) → GPU accumulates head results → Projection
```。Key scheduling considerations: (a) Dual row buffer允许retrieval PNM access与PIM MAC operations同时进行；(b) PIM commands和PNM commands通过MNM Controller统一调度，每HBM channel独立issue；(c) PIM operations across所有banks同步执行（all-bank parallel），harnessing PIM的maximum internal bandwidth。

