PIM-based GEMV kernel的实现方式因PIM architecture而异：(1) MNM/AttAcc-style (HBM-PIM with per-bank MAC)：各bank独立执行GEMV→结果跨bank reduce→适合attention Score/Context，per-bank MAC unit 16 FP16 MAC/cycle @650MHz；(2) HBM-PIM (Samsung Aquabolt-XL[53])：per-bank programmable processing unit，支持MAC和activation functions，适合GEMM和GEMV；(3) Duplex[101]：HBM-PIM with NPU-style tensor units for MoE and GQA acceleration。GEMV kernel mapping到PIM的约束：(a) Data layout需与PIM memory organization对齐——K cache沿d_head维度分布到不同banks（使同一bank row buffer内K^T data在column direction连续），V cache同样沿seq_len维度分布；(b) Q vector segments广播到所有banks via global vector buffer；(c) Partial results需跨bank reduction（score: per-bank partial dot product → accumulate across banks → final score vector）。PIM-based GEMV在decoding phase特别有效因decoding为GEMV-dominant（vs prefill的GEMM-dominant），可叠加continuous batching进一步提升aggregate throughput。

